reakdown — Done\nExpression Sheet — Done\nCombat Reference — Needed","productionNotes":"Use the established production sheet as Terrax''s primary visual canon. Future human artwork should preserve his Indian features, warm brown skin, long black hair, powerful build, earth markings, dark green and earth-toned clothing, antique-gold detailing, jewelry, and ancient fantasy aesthetic. His dragon form must remain colossal, rocky, mountain-like, winged, and visibly connected to the Telluric Verity.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/302f42c7-2c06-47de-a5ef-6d2940d026bf/reference/1790318701593-terrax-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/302f42c7-2c06-47de-a5ef-6d2940d026bf/alternate/1790318762884-terrax-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"draft","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"Ancient","era":"Primordial","name":"Terrax","race":"Primordial","alias":"Terrance","gender":"Male","titles":"The Earth Primordial\nThe Earth Dragon\nThe First Stone\nThe Mountain Father\nThe One Who Remembers","subrace":"Earth Primordial","summary":"Terrax is the primordial embodiment of Earth and the living foundation of the physical world. His primordial truth, the Telluric Verity, embodies permanence, resilience, gravity, weight, and the memory held within the earth. He rules his own land called Terrax and considers the Stone Mountains a personal sanctuary where he can relax away from his responsibilities.","heritage":"Indian","homeland":"Terrax","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"TBD","nicknames":"","occupation":"Primordial embodiment of Earth","affiliation":"Terrax","apparentAge":"Adult","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"TBD","nationality":"TBD","spoilerLevel":"TBD","pronunciation":"TERR-aks","currentResidence"