ont — Done\nBack View — Done\nLeft View — Done\nRight View — Done\nFace Reference — Done\nEye Reference — Done\nHair Reference — Done\nOutfit Breakdown — Done\nExpression Sheet — Needed\nCombat Reference — Needed","productionNotes":"Use the established production sheet as the primary visual reference for Lánhuá. Her human design should remain elegant, ancient, and imperial with long black hair, ocean-blue eyes, ornate aquatic hairpieces, and layered blue ceremonial robes. Her dragon form must remain a colossal Eastern-style aquatic leviathan with an elongated serpentine body, iridescent blue-teal scales, luminous aquatic mane, and water-and-mist manifestations.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/b2d998c0-1754-4a6a-af91-281d65ded816/reference/1790319612245-shu-m-l-nhu-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/b2d998c0-1754-4a6a-af91-281d65ded816/alternate/1790319622886-shu-m-l-nhu-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"Unknown","era":"Ancient","name":"Shuǐmǔ Lánhuá","race":"Primordial","alias":"Lady Lánhuá","gender":"Female","titles":"Shuǐmǔ Tiān Hòu\nHeavenly Empress, Mother of All Waters\nThe Splendid Orchid\nMother of All Waters","subrace":"Living Embodiment of Water","summary":"Shuǐmǔ Lánhuá is the ancient Primordial and living embodiment of Water itself. She does not merely command water; oceans, seas, ice, rain, mist, currents, and other natural forms of water are expressions of her primordial existence. Known among mortals as Lady Lánhuá, she rules the Sunken Domain, which encompasses the world''s waters rather than existing within Aethelgard. She is the mother of Rahim, Ife, and Ruchika.","heritage":"Asian","homeland":"Sunken Domain","pronouns":"She/Her","birthDate":"TBD","nicknames":"","occupation":"Primordial Sovereign of Water","affiliation":"Sunken Domain","apparentAge":"TBD","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"The Splendid Orchid, Mother of Waters","nationality":"TBD","spoilerLevel":"TBD","pronunciation":"TBD","currentResidence":"Sunken Domain","elementalHeritage":"Primordial Water"},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Elemental fluidity\nExtreme water pressure\nEnvironmental control\nAquatic dominion\nAncient primordial power","weaknesses":"TBD","combatStyle":["Fluid","Defensive","Environmental","Pressure-based","Large-scale elemental control"],"limitations":["TBD"],"powerSource":["Primordial Water","Living embodiment of Water"],"abilityNotes":"Her authority over water comes from being its primordial embodiment, not from conventional learned water magic. Exact limits and interactions with other Primordials remain TBD.\n\nDo not classify Lánhuá as a Dragon Primal who merely rules water. She is a Primordial and the living embodiment of Water itself.","combatProfile":"Lánhuá fights as an elemental force rather than a conventional warrior. She changes water between liquid, ice, mist, and highly compressed states while manipulating currents, pressure, and surrounding moisture. Her movements remain controlled and graceful until extreme anger causes her power to become devastatingly violent.","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"Human Form\nAbyssal Leviathan Form","primaryAbilities":"Absolute water manipulation\nPhase manipulation\nHydrostatic pressure manipulation\nIce manipulation\nMist manipulation\nRain manipulation\nCurrent manipulation\nAbyssal command","secondaryAbilities":"Water compression\nTemperature manipulation\nAquatic telepathy\nSea-life command\nAtmospheric moisture manipulation","signatureTechniques":"TBD","transformationDetails":"Lánhuá can manifest as a colossal Eastern-style aquatic dragon or sea serpent. Her elongated body carries iridescent midnight-blue, teal, and seafoam scales with a flowing bioluminescent mane. Rather than conventional leathery wings, her established dragon design can manifest immense wings formed from compressed water, mist, and atmospheric moisture."},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Slender","Graceful","Regal"],"nails":["TBD"],"eyeHex":["TBD"],"height":"TBD","makeup":["Subtle","Elegant"],"weight":"TBD","hairHex":["#090D18"],"skinHex":["TBD"],"eyeColor":["Ocean blue"],"grooming":"Immaculate and imperial.","skinTone":["Fair"],"wardrobe":"Layered ceremonial robes\nImperial water-themed gowns\nFlowing silk garments","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"Very long black hair styled with ornate water-themed hairpieces.","accessories":"Ice orchid hair ornaments\nOrnate hairpins\nWater-drop earrings\nDragon-scale necklace\nWater orb pendant\nJade ornaments","faceDetails":["Elegant features","Regal expression","Refined facial structure"],"hairTexture":["Straight","Silky"],"colorPalette":"Midnight blue #071A33\nDeep teal #07566B\nSeafoam #67C8C2\nTurquoise #46CFE0\nSilver #C8D5DF\nPearl white #EEF3F4","dominantHand":"TBD","outfitColors":"Midnight blue\nDeep teal\nTurquoise\nSilver\nPearl white","alternateForm":["Abyssal Leviathan","Eastern-style sea dragon"],"clothingStyle":"Regal 500–1300 AD-inspired Asian fantasy clothing with flowing silhouettes, layered silks, wave motifs, and refined ornamentation.","appearanceNotes":"Her human design should feel ancient, serene, elegant, and unmistakably connected to the ocean. Her clothing and hair should appear to move with subtle underwater fluidity even on land. Maintain the established midnight-blue, teal, turquoise, silver, and pearl palette across all artwork.","outfitMaterials":["Silk","Translucent silk","Fine embroidery"],"postureMovement":["Poised","Fluid","Controlled"],"signatureOutfit":"Flowing multi-layered imperial robes inspired by 500–1300 AD Asian dress, combining midnight blue, deep teal, silver, and translucent water-like layers. Fine wave and orchid motifs decorate the fabric.","distinguishingFeatures":["Ocean-blue eyes","Very long black hair","Water-themed hair ornaments","Regal presence"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T06:48:09.359491+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T07:48:03.978038+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":["TBD"],"goals":["Protect the Sunken Domain","Preserve aquatic life","Safeguard her family"],"beliefs":["Water sustains life","Water must remain balanced"],"culture":["Ancient aquatic court","Asian-inspired imperial aesthetic"],"lineage":"Primordial embodiment of Water.","storyArc":"Her larger story arc remains TBD. Rahim''s disappearance creates an unresolved thread within her family, while Ife and Ruchika maintain connections to her domain despite residing with their fathers.","backstory":"Lánhuá is one of the ancient Primordials and the living embodiment of Water. Her sovereignty is not limited to a single ocean or continent; the Sunken Domain encompasses the waters of the world. Her unions with Ignis produced Rahim and Ife, while her union with Terrax produced Ruchika. Although Ife and Ruchika reside with their fathers, they remain connected to their mother''s domain and visit her. Rahim is currently lost, and his absence remains unresolved.","childhood":"TBD","lifestyle":["Rules the Sunken Domain","Oversees the waters of the world","Receives visits from her children"],"storyRole":"Lánhuá serves as the primordial embodiment of Water and sovereign of the Sunken Domain. Her existence connects the oceans, aquatic civilizations, and several elemental bloodlines through her children Rahim, Ife, and Ruchika.","birthplace":"TBD","psychology":["Emotionally restrained","Deeply maternal","Patient observer","Terrifying when enraged"],"motivations":["Protect her children","Preserve the waters","Maintain natural balance"],"personality":["Patient","Calm","Soft-spoken","Graceful","Observant","Maternal","Protective","Formidable"],"voiceSpeech":["Soft-spoken","Measured","Regal","Controlled"],"likesDislikes":["TBD"],"majorLifeEvents":"Union with Ignis\nBirth of Rahim\nBirth of Ife\nUnion with Terrax\nBirth of Ruchika\nRahim disappeared\nIfe resides with Ignis\nRuchika resides with Terrax"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/b2d998c0-1754-4a6a-af91-281d65ded816/portrait/1790319597422-shu-m-l-nhu-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"TBD","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"","partner":"","children":"Rahim — Son; Blood Dragon; child with Ignis; currently lost\nIfe — Daughter; Steam Dragon; child with Ignis; resides with her father and visits Lánhuá\nRuchika — Son; Bone Dragon; child with Terrax; resides with his father and visits Lánhuá","siblings":"","worldConnections":"Ignis — Father of Rahim and Ife\nTerrax — Father of Ruchika\nSunken Domain — Her primordial realm\nWorld waters — Her elemental existence","relationshipNotes":"Lánhuá is the mother of Rahim, Ife, and Ruchika. Rahim and Ife are her children with Ignis, while Ruchika is her child with Terrax. Ife and Ruchika live with their fathers but retain a connection and form of sovereignty within their mother''s waters and continue to visit her. Rahim remains lost; his established disappearance and story should not be overwritten."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"f0c6ce62-f547-4fc2-8765-6a9f8bebc590","realm_record_id":"065f06b5-4812-4543-9430-02830d72ae0b","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"3e083a30-190f-4d2e-a61c-605c24c21769","faction_record_id":"9eabcca3-b901-4fdb-92da-03d6ab2a98c5"}','2026-09-25T08:07:51.315974+00:00');
